  "description": "Jin Kyung-Tae enjoys toying with celebrities he finds attractive and then discarding them. His attention is drawn once again to Ryu Tae-On, a rookie actor. Just as the groundwork is finished and he’s about to have his way with Tae-On, Kyung-Tae loses consciousness. When he opens his eyes, he finds himself locked up in an unfamiliar place. And something feels off. There was a third person watching Kyung-Tae from where he was being held captive... \n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
